"List all languages for which you want to use sitemodule - en, es, cz, ..<br>Please <b>do it</b>, even if you are using 1 language. <br>It is quite necessary if you want to call sitemodule newer way from Apache:<br> RewriteEngine on<br> RewriteRule ^\$ /apc-aa/modules/site/site.php [L,QSA]<br> RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f<br> RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d<br> RewriteRule ^ /apc-aa/modules/site/site.php [L,QSA]<br>" => "\xA5\xB5\xA5\xA4\xA5\xC8\xA5\xE2\xA5\xB8\xA5\xE5\xA1\xBC\xA5\xEB\xA4\xF2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xB9\xA4\xEB\xC1\xB4\xA4\xC6\xA4\xCE\xB8\xC0\xB8\xEC\xA4\xF2\xCE\xF3\xB5\xF3\xA4\xB7\xA4\xC6\xA4\xAF\xA4\xC0\xA4\xB5\xA4\xA4 - en, es, cz, ..<br>1 \xA4\xC4\xA4\xCE\xB8\xC0\xB8\xEC\xA4\xCE\xA4\xDF\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xB9\xA4\xEB\xBE\xEC\xB9\xE7\xA4\xC7\xA4\xE2<b>\xC9\xAC\xA4\xBA\xB5\xAD\xC6\xFE</b>\xA4\xB7\xA4\xC6\xA4\xAF\xA4\xC0\xA4\xB5\xA4\xA4\xA1\xA3<br>Apache \xA4\xAB\xA4\xE9\xBF\xB7\xA4\xB7\xA4\xA4\xCA\xFD\xCB\xA1\xA4\xC7\xA5\xB5\xA5\xA4\xA5\xC8\xA5\xE2\xA5\xB8\xA5\xE5\xA1\xBC\xA5\xEB\xA4\xF2\xB8\xC6\xA4\xD3\xBD\xD0\xA4\xB9\xBE\xEC\xB9\xE7\xA4\xCB\xC9\xAC\xCD\xD7\xA4\xC7\xA4\xB9:<br> RewriteEngine on<br> RewriteRule ^\$ /apc-aa/modules/site/site.php [L,QSA]<br> RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f<br> RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d<br> RewriteRule ^ /apc-aa/modules/site/site.php [L,QSA]<br>", // ai 2026-06

