// include/transformation.class.php, row 693
"Each translation on new line, translations separated by colon : (escape character for colon is #:).<br>You can use also aliases in the translation. There is also special alias _#0, which contain matching text - following translation is perfectly OK:<br><code> Bio:&lt;img src=\"_#0.jpg\"&gt; ({publish_date....})</code><br>You can also use Regular Expressions - in such case the line would be \"<code>:regexp:<regular expression>:<output></code>\". You can use _#0 alias in <output>, which contains whole matching text.<br>Sometimes you want to remove specific value. In such case use <code>AA_NULL</code> text as translated text:<br> <code>Bio:AA_NULL</code><br>You may want also create more than one value from a value. Then separate the values by colon:<br> <code>Bio:Environment:Ecology</code> (\"Bio\" is replaced by two values). You can use any number of values here." => "\xB3\xC6\xCB\xDD\xCC\xF5\xA4\xCF\xBF\xB7\xA4\xB7\xA4\xA4\xB9\xD4\xA4\xCB\xB5\xAD\xBD\xD2\xA4\xB7\xA1\xA2\xCB\xDD\xCC\xF5\xA4\xCF\xA5\xB3\xA5\xED\xA5\xF3 : \xA4\xC7\xB6\xE8\xC0\xDA\xA4\xEA\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xCA\xA5\xB3\xA5\xED\xA5\xF3\xA4\xCE\xA5\xA8\xA5\xB9\xA5\xB1\xA1\xBC\xA5\xD7\xCA\xB8\xBB\xFA\xA4\xCF #: \xA4\xC7\xA4\xB9\xA1\xCB\xA1\xA3<br>\xCB\xDD\xCC\xF5\xA4\xCB\xA4\xCF\xCA\xCC\xCC\xBE\xA4\xE2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xC7\xA4\xAD\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3\xB0\xEC\xC3\xD7\xA4\xB7\xA4\xBF\xA5\xC6\xA5\xAD\xA5\xB9\xA5\xC8\xA4\xF2\xB4\xDE\xA4\xE0\xC6\xC3\xCA\xCC\xA4\xCA\xCA\xCC\xCC\xBE _#0 \xA4\xE2\xA4\xA2\xA4\xEA\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3\xBC\xA1\xA4\xCE\xCB\xDD\xCC\xF5\xA4\xCF\xA4\xDE\xA4\xC3\xA4\xBF\xA4\xAF\xCC\xE4\xC2\xEA\xA4\xA2\xA4\xEA\xA4\xDE\xA4\xBB\xA4\xF3:<br><code> Bio:&lt;img src=\"_#0.jpg\"&gt; ({publish_date....})</code><br>\xC0\xB5\xB5\xAC\xC9\xBD\xB8\xBD\xA4\xE2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xC7\xA4\xAD\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3\xA4\xBD\xA4\xCE\xBE\xEC\xB9\xE7\xA1\xA2\xB9\xD4\xA4\xCF \"<code>:regexp:<regular expression>:<output></code>\" \xA4\xC8\xA4\xCA\xA4\xEA\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3<output> \xA4\xC7\xA4\xCF\xB0\xEC\xC3\xD7\xA4\xB7\xA4\xBF\xA5\xC6\xA5\xAD\xA5\xB9\xA5\xC8\xC1\xB4\xC2\xCE\xA4\xF2\xB4\xDE\xA4\xE0\xCA\xCC\xCC\xBE _#0 \xA4\xF2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xC7\xA4\xAD\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3<br>\xC6\xC3\xC4\xEA\xA4\xCE\xC3\xCD\xA4\xF2\xBA\xEF\xBD\xFC\xA4\xB7\xA4\xBF\xA4\xA4\xBE\xEC\xB9\xE7\xA4\xCF\xA1\xA2\xCB\xDD\xCC\xF5\xB8\xE5\xA4\xCE\xA5\xC6\xA5\xAD\xA5\xB9\xA5\xC8\xA4\xC8\xA4\xB7\xA4\xC6 <code>AA_NULL</code> \xA4\xF2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xB7\xA4\xC6\xA4\xAF\xA4\xC0\xA4\xB5\xA4\xA4:<br> <code>Bio:AA_NULL</code><br>\xB0\xEC\xA4\xC4\xA4\xCE\xC3\xCD\xA4\xAB\xA4\xE9\xCA\xA3\xBF\xF4\xA4\xCE\xC3\xCD\xA4\xF2\xBA\xEE\xC0\xAE\xA4\xB9\xA4\xEB\xA4\xB3\xA4\xC8\xA4\xE2\xA4\xC7\xA4\xAD\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3\xA4\xBD\xA4\xCE\xBE\xEC\xB9\xE7\xA4\xCF\xC3\xCD\xA4\xF2\xA5\xB3\xA5\xED\xA5\xF3\xA4\xC7\xB6\xE8\xC0\xDA\xA4\xEA\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9:<br> <code>Bio:Environment:Ecology</code>\xA1\xCA\"Bio\" \xA4\xCF\xC6\xF3\xA4\xC4\xA4\xCE\xC3\xCD\xA4\xCB\xC3\xD6\xA4\xAD\xB4\xB9\xA4\xA8\xA4\xE9\xA4\xEC\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xCB\xA1\xA3\xA4\xB3\xA4\xB3\xA4\xC7\xA4\xCF\xC7\xA4\xB0\xD5\xA4\xCE\xBF\xF4\xA4\xCE\xC3\xCD\xA4\xF2\xBB\xC8\xCD\xD1\xA4\xC7\xA4\xAD\xA4\xDE\xA4\xB9\xA1\xA3", // ai 2026-06

